 <h3><u>Aye rabbe panjetan</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Ae rabbe panjetan..(3)<br> meri tujhse hai ye dua</p> 
  <p>1. Parwardigar tu hi rahim o karim hai<br> quran keh raha hai ali o azeem hai<br> awaze qul se pehle hai itna qadeem hai<br> ae rabbe panjetan..(2)<br> wajib hai kaenaat pe har dam teri sanaa</p> 
  <p>2. Chaha jo tune khalq me pehchaan ho teri<br> tune banai 5 sitaro ki ek ladi<br> unki raza me teri raza hai chupi hui<br> ae rabbe panjetan..(2)<br> naraaz hum se ho na kabhi aale mustafa</p> 
  <p>3. Tanhaiyo ka teri raha hai jo hamsafar<br> wo mustafa jo baad tere sabse motabar<br> hai qarz jiska ajr e risalat jahan par<br> ae rabbe panjetan..(2)<br> har qarz karde ghaib se maqrooz ka ada</p> 
  <p>4. Tujhsa ali bhi kehta hai khaliq jise ali<br> ungli pakadke jiski shariat teri chali<br> raziq hai do jahaan ka waliyo ka hai wali<br> ae rabbe panjetan..(2)<br> sadqe me uske rizq me ho wus'ate ataa</p> 
  <p>5. Wo fatima hijab bhi noori mila jise<br> hasnain jaise jisne pisar paal kar diye<br> rehmat bani jo rehmate aalam ke waaste<br> ae rabbe panjetan..(2)<br> tute na momineen se rehmat ka silsila</p> 
  <p>6. Wo mustafa ka laal jo dee ko bacha gaya<br> tegho ko apne zor e qalam se hara gaya<br> amno amaa ka dars jaha ko padha gaya<br> ae rabbe panjetan..(2)<br> har samt uske sadqe me ho amn ki faza</p> 
  <p>7. Mabood wo husain jo mehboob hai tera<br> sar kaat kar bhi jiska na zalim jhuka saka<br> jisne zamee ko arsh e mo'alla bana diya<br> ae rabbe panjetan..(2)<br> dikhla de hum faqeer o ko roza husain ka<br> ae rabbe panjetan..(2)</p> 
  <p>8. Mushkil ko taal halle masaeb ko bhej de<br> hai jiske muntazir usi saheb ko bhej de<br> mushkil kusha ke akhri naeb ko bhej de<br> ae rabbe panjetan..(2)<br> hai sibt e jafar aur hasan ki ye ilteja</p> 
  <p>Ae rabbe panjetan..(3)<br> meri tujhse hai ye dua<br> Allah Allah Allah<br> Allah Allah Allah</p> 
